[2026-06-26 13:03] 🎨 FRONTEND: === FRONTEND ENGINEERING STARTED ===
[2026-06-26 13:03] FRONTEND: Architecture: block-based editor with CRDT state + optimistic UI

[2026-06-26 13:03] FRONTEND: === UI STATE MODEL ===
  Local CRDT State:
    blocks: Map<blockId, Block>
    positions: OrderMap<blockId, fractionalIndex>
    pendingEvents: Event[]
    appliedHlc: HLC watermark
    syncStatus: 'synced' | 'syncing' | 'error' | 'offline'

  UI State:
    selectedBlock: blockId | null
    editingBlock: blockId | null
    collaborators: Map<userId, { name, cursor }>
    workspace: { id, name, role }
    error: string | null

[2026-06-26 13:03] FRONTEND: === OPTIMISTIC RENDERING LOGIC ===
  User action → create CRDT event locally
  1. Apply event to local state IMMEDIATELY
  2. Render updated UI
  3. Push event to server (async)
  4. Server responds with confirmed HLC
  5. If server HLC differs → reconcile

  Rollback strategy:
    - Если server error → revert local state
    - Keep pending events in queue
    - Retry with exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 4s, max 30s)

  Rendering order:
    - blocks sorted by position (fractional index)
    - deleted blocks (tombstone) are hidden
    - conflict indicator if local != server state

[2026-06-26 13:03] FRONTEND: === BLOCK-BASED EDITOR COMPONENTS ===
  WorkspaceView:
    - Header: name, collaborators list, sync status
    - BlockList: sortable, draggable blocks

  BlockRenderer:
    - by type: text, image, checklist, divider
    - Editable on click
    - Shows cursor for collaborators

  CollaboratorCursor:
    - Colored cursor per user
    - Position synced via events

  SyncVisualizer:
    - Status indicator: ✅ 🔄 ❌ 📴
    - Pending events count
    - Last synced timestamp
    - Conflict count badge

  OfflineBanner:
    - Shows pending changes count
    - "Changes will sync when online"

[2026-06-26 13:03] FRONTEND: === SYNC VISUALIZATION STRATEGY ===
  - Green: all events confirmed up to last HLC
  - Yellow: events pending, retrying
  - Red: retry failed after max backoff
  - Gray: offline
  - Badge: number of unconfirmed events
  - Click indicator → shows detailed sync log
